claim.claim-text:
an airfoil fairing (62) having a fairing platform (66) and a hollow airfoil section (64) extending from the fairing platform (66);
a spar (72) having a spar leg (72b) extending in the hollow airfoil section (64), the spar leg (72b) having a spar leg periphery (72d);
a seal plate (80) secured with the fairing platform (66), the seal plate (80) having an opening (82a), the opening (82a) having an opening periphery (82a-1) that is complementary to the spar leg periphery (72d), the spar leg (72b) extending through the opening (82a); and
a seal (86a) between the seal plate (80) and the spar leg (72b), the seal (86a) sealing around the spar leg periphery (72d),
wherein the seal (86a) consists of a weldment.

a compressor section (24);
a combustor (56) in fluid communication with the compressor section (24); and
a turbine section (28) in fluid communication with the combustor (56), the turbine section (28) having airfoil assemblies (60) disposed about a central axis (A) of the gas turbine engine (20), each of the airfoil assemblies (60) being an airfoil assembly (60) as recited in any preceding claim.
